::ALG2_U03_L02_Q11::
Question ID: ALG2_U03_L02_Q11
MLA Standard: MLA.A2.RR.2
Question:
Which describes g(x) \= sqrt(x) - 7?
{
~A. shift left 7#This identifies the wrong transformation. Changes inside the radical affect horizontal movement; changes outside the radical affect vertical movement.
~B. shift right 7#This identifies the wrong transformation. Changes inside the radical affect horizontal movement; changes outside the radical affect vertical movement.
=C. shift down 7#Correct. Subtracting outside the radical shifts the graph down.
~D. reflect over x-axis#This identifies the wrong transformation. Changes inside the radical affect horizontal movement; changes outside the radical affect vertical movement.
}


